		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>bonjour,</p><br /><p>non.</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>&quot;enable_bitmapscan&quot;;&quot;on&quot;
&quot;enable_hashagg&quot;;&quot;on&quot;
&quot;enable_hashjoin&quot;;&quot;on&quot;
&quot;enable_indexscan&quot;;&quot;on&quot;
&quot;enable_material&quot;;&quot;on&quot;
&quot;enable_mergejoin&quot;;&quot;on&quot;
&quot;enable_nestloop&quot;;&quot;on&quot;
&quot;enable_seqscan&quot;;&quot;on&quot;
&quot;enable_sort&quot;;&quot;on&quot;
&quot;enable_tidscan&quot;;&quot;on&quot;</code></pre></div><p>Ceci étant dit je préfère les plans avec les merge join sur index vu qu&#039;ils sont, dans ce cas, beaucoup plus rapide que des table scan.</p>]]></content>
